From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:03:25 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: apple,macaudio: Add the J614s cards

The J614s (MacBook Pro 14-inch, M4 Pro) has the same speaker amps and
headphone codec on the same AOP streams as the J616s, in a different
chassis with different speakers. Add the speaker and jack card
compatibles for it, so the 14-inch reports its own identity to
userspace.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
(cherry picked from commit 2f60c92762f32e19cb0f18169d7e23665f798a02)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
index 755c5d195c..e0b330720f 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
@@ -20,6 +20,8 @@ properties:
           - apple,j274-macaudio
           - apple,j293-macaudio
           - apple,j314-macaudio
+          - apple,j614-macaudio
+          - apple,j614-macaudio-jack
           - apple,j616-macaudio
           - apple,j616-macaudio-jack
           - apple,j700-macaudio
